# SH_MAMESOCK_KEYMAP — generated by scripts/dev/mame-keymap.py from KEYDUMP
# PLACEHOLDER: not yet dumped from a live riscos3 ctlsock (native MAME
# binary was still building when this scaffold landed). Empty on purpose —
# an absent/empty keymap means the daemon falls back to raw scancodes,
# which is wrong for aa310's :keyboard:ROW.* matrix. Regenerate with:
#   scripts/dev/mame-keymap.py <ctl.sock> --tags :keyboard: --out riscos3.keymap
# against a running riscos3 rig before promoting past keyboard smoke.
